@Host = http://localhost:5085
@DeviceId = local-8085

### Dashboard
GET {{Host}}/api/hardware/dashboard
Accept: application/json

### DiagnoseTool: Katalog aller Fernsteuer-Endpunkte
GET {{Host}}/api/hardware/devices/{{DeviceId}}/remote

### DiagnoseTool: Gesamtzustand
GET {{Host}}/api/hardware/devices/{{DeviceId}}/remote-overview

### DiagnoseTool: Tools abfragen
GET {{Host}}/api/hardware/devices/{{DeviceId}}/remote/tools

### DiagnoseTool: OCCT starten
POST {{Host}}/api/hardware/devices/{{DeviceId}}/remote/control/tools/OCCT/launch
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### DiagnoseTool: SFC-Reparatur starten
POST {{Host}}/api/hardware/devices/{{DeviceId}}/remote/control/repair/sfc
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### DiagnoseTool: Akkutest (30 Min., mit Video-Last)
POST {{Host}}/api/hardware/devices/{{DeviceId}}/remote/control/battery-test/start
Content-Type: application/json

{ "durationMinutes": 30, "openVideo": true }

### DiagnoseTool: Tab wechseln
POST {{Host}}/api/hardware/devices/{{DeviceId}}/remote/control/ui/tab
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tab": "cpu" }

### DiagnoseTool: System-Prüfbericht als PDF
GET {{Host}}/api/hardware/devices/{{DeviceId}}/remote/report/system
